      "title": "Adjunct Assistant Professor",
      "description": "ODU - Job Site | Adjunct Assistant Professor Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Job Interest Cards/Categories Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ Applicant Alternative Hiring FAQ Staff and Administrative & Professional Faculty Applicants: Contact Human Resources at: (757) 683-3042 HRRecruitment@odu.edu Teaching and Research Faculty Applicants: Contact Academic Affairs at: aafacultyemployment@odu.edu Adjunct Assistant Professor Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening. To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Applicants must apply online at https://jobs.odu.edu/postings/25663 . A complete application will include; A cover letter. A curriculum vitae with exhibition record links to web site or other that shows studio work. Unofficial Transcripts. Contact information for three professional references. . Posting Details Posting Details Job Title Adjunct Assistant Professor Department ART Position Number PT0010 Job Description The Art Department invites applicants for part time instructional faculty to teach 100 and 200 level courses. All studio disciplines are encouraged to apply for opportunities that may arise. These are in-person, Norfolk campus positions with classes that operate between 9AM and 1010PM in 2 hour 50 minute blocks. 10 month appointment with possibility of renewal. Position Type Part-Time Type of Recruitment General Public Type of Recruitment General Public Minimum required education and/or special licenses, registrations, trainings, or certifications MFA in studio art Minimum requir